<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Happy Birthday ❤️</title>

<style>
body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial;
text-align:center;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9a9e,#fad0c4);
color:white;
}

#tapScreen{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
font-size:28px;
cursor:pointer;
}

#mainContent{
display:none;
padding:20px;
}

h1{
font-size:40px;
}

img{
width:220px;
border-radius:15px;
margin:10px;
box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

button{
padding:12px 25px;
font-size:18px;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
background:#ff4b6e;
color:white;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:20px;
}

#letter{
display:none;
background:white;
color:black;
padding:20px;
border-radius:15px;
margin-top:20px;
}
</style>

<script>
function startSite(){
document.getElementById("tapScreen").style.display="none";
document.getElementById("mainContent").style.display="block";
}

function openLetter(){
document.getElementById("letter").style.display="block";
}
</script>

</head>

<body>

<div id="tapScreen" onclick="startSite()">
Tap Anywhere 💖
</div>

<div id="mainContent">

<h1>Happy Birthday 🎂</h1>

<p>You are the most special person in my life ❤️</p>

<img src="IMG_20260311_211104.jpg">
<img src="IMG_20260311_211146.jpg">
<img src="Snapchat-149975219.jpg">
<img src="Snapchat-2047668849.jpg">

<br>

<button onclick="openLetter()">Open Birthday Letter 💌</button>

<div id="letter">
<h2>My Letter To You ❤️</h2>
<p>
Happy Birthday to the most amazing friend!  
Thank you for always being there for me.  
Your smile makes everything better and your friendship means the world to me.  

I hope this year brings you happiness, success, and lots of beautiful moments.  

You will always be special to me. 💖
</p>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
